Wait, actually real Lua: `lua` without `-` reads from stdin with name "stdin" and `handle_stdin`? Let me recall lua.c 5.4:

```c
static int handle_stdin (lua_State *L) {
  int status = dolibrary(L);  /* load libraries */
  if (status == LUA_OK) {
    status = dochunk(L, 0);
